cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "BulkNMFGenerator: NMF and DP-NMF synthetic bulk RNA-seq generator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wicks
    given-names: Andrew
version: 1.0.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndrewJWicks/BulkNMFGenerator"
abstract: >-
  Generator of synthetic bulk RNA-seq data based on non-negative matrix
  factorisation, with a non-private variant (NMF) and a differentially private
  variant (DP-NMF). Used to produce the NMF and DP-NMF synthetic TCGA-BRCA and
  TCGA-COMBINED datasets in the CAMDA Health Privacy Challenge benchmark.
keywords:
  - synthetic data
  - bulk RNA-seq
  - non-negative matrix factorisation
  - differential privacy
  - TCGA
